 6. When a project thread reaches terminal, its final text or a Kanban comment is not a Telegram status. In the same handling cycle, read the final result and send a short status via the native gateway to the existing project topic, then independently read the text and forum reply header there. For stalled work say whether the actor is still active, awaiting H acceptance, or genuinely blocked; do not imply continuous background work after a completed run. Keep the current result/cursor and delivery receipt in the tracker. Do not add polling schedules or another implementation worker to compensate for a missing delivery. If an owner complains that topics went silent, check the tracked runs and actual destination history before diagnosing transport or claiming an automatic callback worked.
 
